UPDATE companies SET description='Custom Wire Industries, Inc. was founded in 1968 in Muskego, Wisconsin. The company has operated continuously from its Wisconsin base for over five decades.

The company manufactures electrical wire and cable assemblies, wire harnesses, ribbon cables, overmolded assemblies, lead wires, electromechanical devices, control panels, power transmission assemblies, and sensor cables. Its capabilities span cable fabrication, wire harness assembly, electromechanical assembly, custom tooling, injection molding, CAD-based design, kitting, and turnkey system integration. Assemblies range from microscopic components to 900-pound alert tower units. The engineering team uses a fully capable CAD system to generate working drawings and provide design services.

Custom Wire Industries serves medical, military, industrial, telecommunications, and automotive sectors. Customers include OEMs and manufacturers requiring custom cable assemblies for equipment such as diagnostic medical devices, military-spec power systems, and industrial control panels. The company emphasizes consolidated sourcing, allowing clients to purchase all components together to reduce shipping and labor costs.

The company highlights its UL and CSA certifications, strict quality control processes at each manufacturing stage, and a commitment to 100% quality management. It promotes affordable pricing, fast turnaround times, and low defect rates as key differentiators. Since its founding, it has focused on delivering customized electromechanical assemblies, control panels, and power cable assemblies tailored to exact specifications.', certifications=ARRAY['UL','CSA']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Cable fabrication", "Wire harness assembly", "Electromechanical assembly", "Control panel manufacturing", "Power cable assembly", "Overmolding", "Injection molding", "Custom tooling", "CAD design", "Kitting", "Turnkey system integration", "Sensor cable fabrication", "Ribbon cable fabrication", "Lead wire fabrication", "Electromechanical device assembly", "Assembly kit fabrication", "Custom electrical component manufacturing"], "industries": ["Medical", "Military", "Industrial", "Telecommunications", "Automotive"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["CAD system", "Injection molding equipment", "Custom tooling"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["UL and CSA certified manufacturing", "Fast turnaround times on custom assemblies", "Turnkey electromechanical assembly and kitting", "In-house CAD design and custom tooling", "Injection molding and overmolding capabilities"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1968 -> db", "Headquarters in Muskego, Wisconsin -> db", "UL and CSA certified manufacturer -> /", "Manufactures electrical wire and cable assemblies -> /", "Capabilities include cable fabrication, wire harness assembly, electromechanical assembly, control panels, overmolding, injection molding, custom tooling, CAD design, kitting, turnkey systems -> /", "Serves medical, military, industrial, telecommunications, automotive industries -> /", "Assemblies range from microscopic to 900-pound units -> /", "Fast turnaround times and affordable pricing -> /", "Strict qu