UPDATE companies SET description='Cutlist CO operates as a digital fabrication studio in Denver, Colorado. The company was founded in 2006 and has accumulated two decades of experience in precision cutting services.

The shop provides CNC routing and laser cutting services using a ShopSabre CNC router equipped with a 12-position automatic tool changer and vacuum hold-down, plus a pro-series laser cutter and 3D printing capabilities. It processes full 48-by-96-inch sheets, handling 2D profiles, dados, pockets, drill patterns, laser cutting, engraving, and nested part optimization for batch runs of 500 pieces or more. Most jobs are completed within 10 business days.

Customers include artists, makers, builders, designers, woodworkers, and small businesses across sectors such as art installations, interior design, furniture, cabinetry, custom shelving, prototypes, models, jigs, storage solutions, signage, marketing components, and retail displays. The company accepts DXF, SVG, 3D CAD models, and dimensioned drawings, converting them into cut files while leaving design work to the client.

Cutlist CO differentiates itself by focusing solely on cutting—delivering clean, precise parts ready for customer finishing and assembly—and by sourcing materials directly to ensure consistent quality, flatness, and machine compatibility. A $500 job minimum applies to CNC routing, and the studio offers local delivery for larger orders while maintaining a pickup-only policy for most work.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["CNC routing (2D profiles, dados, pockets, drill patterns)", "Laser cutting", "Laser engraving", "Nested part optimization from full sheets", "Batch production", "Design file preparation (DXF, SVG, 3D CAD to cut files)", "3D printing", "Material sourcing and procurement"], "industries": ["Artists", "Makers", "Builders", "Designers", "Woodworkers", "Small businesses", "Art installations", "Interior design", "Furniture", "Cabinetry", "Custom shelving", "Prototyping", "Models", "Jigs and fixtures", "Storage solutions", "Signage", "Marketing components", "Retail displays", "Product shelving"], "materials": ["Veneer core plywood", "Baltic birch plywood", "HPL laminated plywood", "Bamboo plywood", "MDF", "Melamine", "Other wood sheet goods", "PVC", "ABS", "Acrylic", "Other plastic sheet goods", "Cardboard", "Paper", "Fabric", "Leather", "Felt", "Foam"], "equipment": ["ShopSabre CNC router with 12-position automatic tool changer and vacuum hold-down", "Pro-series laser cutter", "3D printer"], "volume": "Batch production up to 500+ parts", "lead_time": "10 business days", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Job minimum $500 for CNC routing", "Most jobs ready within 10 business days", "48\" x 96\" sheet capacity with nested material optimization", "ShopSabre CNC router with 12-position automatic tool changer and vacuum hold-down", "Material sourcing for consistent quality and machine compatibility"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2006 -> db", "Headquarters Denver, Colorado -> db, homepage", "Digital fabrication studio with 20 years experience -> homepage", "CNC routing and laser cutting services -> homepage, services page", "ShopSabre CNC router with 12-position automatic tool changer and vacuum hold-down -> services page", "Pro-series laser cutter -> homepage", "3D printing capabilities -> homepage", "48\" x 96\" sheet capacity -> homepage", "Nested parts from full sheets (material optimization) -> homepage", "Batch production (same part \u00d7 500) -> homepage", "Materials: plywood (veneer core, Baltic birch, HPL laminated, bamboo), MDF & melamine, other wood sheet goods, PVC, ABS, acrylic, other plastic sheet goods, cardboard, paper, fabric, leather, felt -> homepage", "Foam -> services page", "Most jobs ready in 10 business days or less -> homepage, services page", "Job minimum $500 for CNC routing -> services page", "No assembly or finishing -> services page", "No metal cutting, no dimensional lumber -> services page", "Accepts DXF, SVG, 3D CAD models, dimensioned drawings -> homepage", "Can help turn designs into cut files but not design -> homepage, services page", "Material sourcing for consistent quality -> services page", "Local delivery available for bigger orders -> homepage", "Pickup only, no shipping -> homepage", "Serves artists, makers, builders, designers, woodworkers, small businesses -> homepage, services page", "Applications: art installation components, interior design statement pieces, furniture, cabinets, custom shelving, prototypes, models, jigs, storage solutions, products, signs, marketing components, retail display, product shelving -> services page"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "We focus on cutting. You''ll receive clean, precise parts ready for your finishing and assembly process. We''re a cut shop, not a cabinet shop.", "founded_year": "2006", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "$500", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now