UPDATE companies SET description='D M Jeffers Company Inc has operated from Richmond, Virginia since its founding in 1982. The company began as a supplier of restaurant equipment and has grown into a full-service resource for commercial kitchen projects across the region.

The firm distributes a broad line of commercial kitchen equipment and smallwares from manufacturers such as Southbend, Blodgett, Garland, Convotherm, True, Turbo Air, and Norlake. Beyond product sales, the company provides kitchen design and layout services, handles installation, and operates a public showroom at its Richmond facility. Orders ship nationwide with options including next-day air and weekend delivery.

The company serves the food-service and hospitality sectors, outfitting new builds and remodels alike.

