UPDATE companies SET description='D Volt Co. was founded in 2022 and is headquartered in Houston, Texas. The company began as a U.S.-based power solutions provider offering fully integrated services from engineering design and precision manufacturing to direct sales and customer support.

The company manufactures, sells, rents, and repairs a range of transformers and electrical equipment, including three-phase and single-phase pad-mount transformers, overhead transformers, dry-type transformers, power transformers, auto reclosers, switchgear, breakers, switches, and accessories. With a vertically integrated model, D Volt Co. controls engineering, manufacturing, assembly, testing, maintenance, and field service in-house. The company reports more than 1,000 units deployed and cites an eight-week lead time for production.

D Volt Co. serves utilities, data centers, renewable energy projects, and industrial clients across North America. Its products are built to UL, DOE, and CSA standards, and the company emphasizes customization to meet project-specific requirements.

The company says its vertically integrated approach gives it control over speed, quality, cost efficiency, and customization, allowing it to offer short lead times and competitive pricing through a global sourcing network and in-house engineering. It also highlights U.S. assembly capability for distribution-size transformers.', certifications=ARRAY['UL','DOE','CSA']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Engineering design", "Precision manufacturing", "Transformer assembly", "Testing and inspection", "Maintenance and repair", "Equipment rental", "Field service", "Customization", "Component sourcing", "Direct sales and customer support"], "industries": ["Utilities", "Data centers", "Renewable energy", "Industrial", "Power infrastructure"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "8 weeks", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Vertically integrated model controlling speed, quality, cost, and customization", "UL, DOE, and CSA certified products", "U.S. assembly for distribution-size transformers", "Eight-week lead time with global sourcing network", "In-house engineering, testing, maintenance, and repair services"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2022 -> /about", "Headquartered in Houston, Texas -> /about", "Manufactures, sells, rents, repairs transformers and electrical equipment -> /", "Product lines include pad-mount, overhead, dry-type, power transformers, auto reclosers, switchgear, breakers, switches, accessories -> /", "1,000+ units deployed -> /", "8-week lead time -> /", "Vertically integrated model with engineering, manufacturing, assembly, testing, maintenance, field service -> /about", "Serves utilities, data centers, renewable energy, industrial clients -> /about", "Products comply with UL, DOE, CSA standards -> /about", "U.S. assembly for distribution-size transformers -> /about", "Customization offered -> /", "Global sourcing network and in-house engineering -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "manu