tive parts. Collaboration with major automotive brands. Capable of meeting various customer needs and providing large quantities of supply.", "founded_year": "2015", "employee_count": "35", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "No MOQ for stock products; 100 pieces for non-stock products", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='dingxin-auto-parts' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='DK Fabrication and Welding operates from Tollesboro, Kentucky, where it has been running as a business for five years. The company is certified as a Service-Disabled Veteran-Owned Small Business (SDVOSB) and is also family-owned, reflecting a blend of military discipline and family values in its operations.

The shop provides custom, structural, ornamental, and industrial metal fabrication, working with steel, stainless steel, aluminum, and specialty alloys across a range of material thicknesses. Core processes include CNC plasma cutting, press brake forming, MIG and TIG welding, and aluminum and structural steel fabrication, enabling both large-scale and intricate projects.

While construction is a primary market, the company also serves automotive, oil and gas, residential, commercial, and industrial sectors, and its SAM.gov registration allows it to pursue government contracts alongside private work.

