UPDATE companies SET description='Denney Electric Supply-Lighting & Design was founded in 1985 in Millsboro, Delaware, as a family-owned business serving the Delmarva Peninsula. The company began by supplying electrical products to local builders and electricians, later expanding into a lighting showroom for homeowners.

