UPDATE companies SET description='DiLanna Foodservice and Paper Products was founded in 1939 in Johnston, Rhode Island, and has remained family-owned across four generations. The company began as a local supplier to neighborhood eateries and has grown into a regional distributor serving all of Rhode Island and southeastern Massachusetts.

