ing -> /about-us", "Proprietary injection molding of UHMW virgin and regrind -> /about-us", "In-house tool design and mold fabrication -> /capabilities", "Injection molding shot sizes 19-311 oz -> /capabilities", "Materials: UHMW-PE, nylon, acetal, urethane, Ultem, PEEK, HDPE, polypropylene + filled -> /capabilities", "CNC machining with HAAS machines -> /capabilities", "Cast urethane hardness 40A-75D -> /capabilities", "Custom fabrication across plastics and metals -> /capabilities", "Expansion to 60,000 sq ft by end of 2025 with four 80,000-lb silos -> /", "Industries: wastewater treatment, mining, forest products, grain handling, car wash, oil tools, brewery -> /about-us, /", "Export to over 15 countries -> /about-us", "In-house recycling ~250,000 lbs scrap annually -> /about-us", "Lean Production processes -> /about-us", "Case studies: snow grooming, drag paddles, rollers, metal-to-plastic, wastewater, wear strips -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Diversified Plastics, Inc. is a custom plastics fabrication and engineering company and family business founded by Rod Reid in Missoula, Montana.", "founded_year": "1976", "employee_count": "60+", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": ["Export to over 15 countries"], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='diversified-plastics-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 1994 in Fredericksburg, Virginia, Dominion Steel began as a small fabrication shop and has grown into a full-service steel center serving Virginia, Maryland, and the District of Columbia. The company has operated continuously for nearly three decades, establishing itself as a regional leader in structural steel fabrication and erection.

Dominion Steel operates a 35,000-square-foot fabrication facility equipped with modern tooling and an on-site quality assurance team. The company provides turnkey structural steel services — estimating, detailing, fabrication, and erection — along with miscellaneous metal fabrication in stainless steel and aluminum, welding, structural coating, and railing and gate systems. This integrated approach allows the firm to control quality, scheduling, and cost across projects ranging from single components to multi-story structural systems.

The company serves general contractors, architects, engineers, and developers across education, healthcare, entertainment, government, and commercial sectors. Its portfolio includes schools, healthcare facilities, entertainment venues, and government buildings throughout the Mid-Atlantic region.

Leadership highlights the firm''s willingness to tackle complex, difficult projects that other shops decline, backed by a dedicated team of fabrication professionals.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Structural steel fabrication", "Structural steel erection", "Miscellaneous metal fabrication", "Stainless steel fabrication", "Aluminum fabrication", "Welding services", "Commercial fabrication", "Structural coating", "Railing and gate fabrication", "Estimating", "Detailing", "Engineering and fabrication", "Quality assurance"], "industries": ["Education", "Healthcare", "Entertainment", "Government", "Commercial"], "materials": ["Structural steel", "Stainless steel", "Aluminum"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Turnkey in-house estimating, detailing, fabrication, and erection", "35,000 sq ft fabrication facility with modern equipment", "On-site full-time quality assurance team", "Expertise in complex, difficult projects other shops decline", "Regional service across Virginia, Maryland, and D.C."], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1994 in Fredericksburg, VA -> /about", "35,000 sq ft fabrication facility -> /about", "Turnkey services: estimating, detailing, fabrication, erection -> /", "Industries served: education, healthcare, entertainment, government, commercial -> /about", "Materials: structural steel, stainless steel, aluminum -> /about", "On-site full-time quality assurance team -> /about", "Tackles tough, complex projects -> /about", "Mission: build legacy of partnership through exceptional client experiences -> /about", "Culture values: integrity, excellence, safety, honesty, respect, gratitude, empowerment -> /about", "Serves Virginia, Maryland, D.C. -> /", "Provides welding, miscellaneous fabrication, structural coating, commercial fabrication, railings & gates -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Dominion Steel has been an industry leader in struc