UPDATE companies SET description='Drews Solar is a family-owned residential solar installer based in Madison, Wisconsin. Michael’s wife, Maria Drews, a civil and environmental engineer and 2024 Wisconsin Clean Energy Champion, co-owns the business and leads customer support.

