UPDATE companies SET description='Duerr Packaging Co Inc was founded in 1953 in Burgettstown, Pennsylvania. The company began as a rigid paper box manufacturer in a well-established, highly competitive industry. It remains an independent, family-operated business now in its second generation, with many employees holding long tenures.

