UPDATE companies SET description='Duncan Electric Supply Co. was founded in 1950 by Kenneth L. Duncan in Bountiful, Utah, as an independent electrical distributor serving the electrical construction industry. The company has operated continuously from its location in what is now West Bountiful, building a reputation for reliable supply over more than seven decades.

